{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PopZen 是一款專為壓力與精神疲勞設計的簡易放鬆工具，透過滿足感十足的泡泡互動、舒緩聲音與柔和視覺效果，讓你在 60 秒內快速重整思緒。無論是工作或學習後的休息、睡前的平靜時刻，還是單純想享受無干擾的減壓體驗，都相當適合。目前原價 US $0.99，正在限時免費，把握機會下載。</p>\n\n<h2>快速減壓放鬆工具</h2>\n<p>PopZen 提供令人滿足的泡泡互動、放鬆聲音與視覺回饋，隨時隨地進行快速壓力重置。介面設計簡單無干擾，無廣告、無訂閱，不需註冊帳號，亦支援離線使用。適合忙碌日間的短暫休息、工作或學習後放鬆，以及思緒紛亂時讓自己平靜下來，將幾秒鐘轉化為平靜的片刻。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-484-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-485-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-486-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-487-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-488-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-489-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PopZen: Stress Reset</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T15:53:56.509180+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}